// ============================================================
// Módulo C — Snapshot do liderado (interpretação da IA sobre
// respostas de pulse). Alimenta o mapa da equipe e a "trilha do
// liderado" enviada de volta a ele.
// ============================================================
model SubordinateAssessment {
  id               String        @id @default(uuid()) @db.Uuid
  organizationId   String        @map("organization_id") @db.Uuid
  leaderId         String        @map("leader_id") @db.Uuid
  memberId         String?       @map("member_id") @db.Uuid
  memberLabel      String        @map("member_label")
  memberPhone      String?       @map("member_phone")
  discPrimary      String?       @map("disc_primary")
  discProfile      Json?         @map("disc_profile")
  cerebralPrimary  CerebralMode? @map("cerebral_primary")
  cerebralProfile  Json?         @map("cerebral_profile")
  sabotageScores   Json?         @map("sabotage_scores")
  aiReading        String?       @map("ai_reading")
  aiTrack          String?       @map("ai_track")
  trackSteps       Json?         @map("track_steps")
  trackGeneratedAt DateTime?     @map("track_generated_at")
  lastPulseSendId  String?       @map("last_pulse_send_id") @db.Uuid
  createdAt        DateTime      @default(now()) @map("created_at")
  updatedAt        DateTime      @updatedAt @map("updated_at")

  @@index([organizationId, leaderId])
  @@index([memberId])
  @@map("subordinate_assessments")
}

